These are exports of my Lojban Anki decks.

I posted these because I'd made changes to the words in my versions
(i.e. correcting the language slightly) that I thought others might
want to use.

In particular, "Lojban gismu Places" has a lot of mods versus what's
currently on Anki.  Someone might want to diff the two versions and
update what's on Anki.

"Randomly Selected Lojban non-gismu brivla" is my own deck,
presented here in case it might be of use to somebody.

